{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1306438-favored-approach","id":1306438,"title":"Favored Approach","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-04-20T22:46:48-07:00","id":1306438,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Favored Approach","content":"Alrighty, so I've been going over Aeon and Core, and I'm wanting to get some feedback.<br /> <br /> Does Favored Approach do anything? I mean, other than dictating where 3 of your attribute dots go.<br /> <br /> What if someone was to just go 7/5/3 (or my favorite, 15 attributes, put wherever), would that actually affect anything at all?<br /> <br /> Honestly I kinda don't get the favored approach thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-21T04:49:26-07:00","id":1306504,"title":"","content":"On a related note, I've been wondering if it does anything post-chargen as well, given as how there's a 15xp surcharge for shifting it and no XP-cost to just Tweak the dots around.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>---------------------------------------------<br /> Supporter of Spirits getting full playable splat design come Exalted 3E.<br /> Refugee from the 3rd Great Edition Wars of D&amp;D. <br /> oWoD Latecomer, Exalted Optimist, Scion ST, Trinity Curious","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/955-yue-ryong","name":"Yue Ryong","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar955_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"147"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-11T09:53:07-07:00","id":1311406,"title":"","content":"So, I guess I should assume I\u2019m right, then? Favored approach doesn\u2019t affect anything other than where those three dots go?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-11T16:53:49-07:00","id":1311454,"title":"","content":"Well I don't have much to add on an official level I can say that when I was reading through the core book recently that exact point came to me as well. Honestly I like the whole 15 points put any way you want idea. So yeah I'm not really sure there's any need to decide a category that you become primarily focused on on a metal game level.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-11T17:29:52-07:00","id":1311460,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1306438-favored-approach?p=1311454#post1311454\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well I don't have much to add on an official level I can say that when I was reading through the core book recently that exact point came to me as well. Honestly I like the whole 15 points put any way you want idea. So yeah I'm not really sure there's any need to decide a category that you become primarily focused on on a metal game level.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah. I just like to know whether I'm missing something is all.<br /> <br /> Honestly in almost every WW/OPP game I've ever played our group usually just made a pool of the points. The categorize your abilities/attributes and put different numbers of points into each bucket was always a little arbitrary and weird to me. It's very rarely actually a game mechanic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-13T09:59:53-07:00","id":1311805,"title":"","content":"On the surface, I think it is just a tool to help player's visualize their character.<br /> <br /> I thought there was some Edge that played off of it, but I think that was just my mind souping Favored Mode.<br /> <br /> Maybe use this as something to build a custom Edge or Gift off of? Maybe give Enhancement or Scale for Favored Approach, potentially limited to certain situations.<br /> <br /> Aside: Instead of 2e, should Favored Mode give Scale instead?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}